# The SQLite database and the two sidecar files WAL mode creates next to it.
# The database is state on a volume, never an artifact in the repository
# (ADR-0007); .env.example points NALANDA_DATABASE_URL here by default, so
# without this a developer's first run leaves three files in `git status`.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# A locally built binary. `go build` with no -o writes it named after the
# package directory.
/server
